## Command

```shell
biome inspect config javascript.resolver.experimentalPnpmCatalogs --path=file.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "javascript": {
    "resolver": { "experimentalPnpmCatalogs": false }
  },
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["**/*.js"],
      "javascript": {
        "resolver": { "experimentalPnpmCatalogs": true }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

